        "notes": "PLACEHOLDER GEOMETRY, CORRECT IN KIND. SRC-007 plate NY-18-64 shows a masonry arcade of pointed arches on rectangular piers; the model previously drew slender bents, which is not this object. Every dimension here -- bay spacing, pier width and depth, arch rise -- is invented, so the arcade is excluded from every dimension callout. What is now right is the shape; what is still wrong is every number in it.",
